Title: Planted Problems

INT. JOE'S DINER - NIGHT

MARA KANE (30s) slides into a booth. She sets down a REVOLVER and a FEDORA. A STRAY DOG noses the door. The TRENCH COAT drips. BEAT.

MARA
Coffee. Black.

MARRA
And a refill.

DR. ADA COLE (60s) watches from the counter.

DR. ADA COLE
You're new in town.

COP #1
Evening.

COP #2
Evening.

EXT. JOES DINER - CONTINUOUS

ADA COLE steps out under the neon. BEN (30s) leans on the SEDAN, holding a FLASHLIGHT.

ADA COLE
Get in.

BEN
Where to?

INT. JOE'S DINER - KITCHEN - LATER

BEN (60s) scrubs a pan. A RADIO plays.

BEN
Long night.

EXT. MOTELL - NIGHT

MARA walks to room 12.

EXT. MOTEL - DAWN

MARA leaves with a SUITCASE.
